    "title": "Carplay Auto for Android",
    "description": "The Carplay Auto for Android simplifies the process of linking your smartphone to your car screen. The easy automation screen makes your device play and pause automatically when it connects to your car screen. The carplay android auto app has a control center that allows you to manage calls, videos, music and other apps on your car screen. This car screen mirroring app allows you to instantly connect your phone to your car display through USB, WIFI and Bluetooth options, so you can enjoy your favorite car play app on the car dashboard. The carplay auto and carplay for android app also offers a hands-free experience letting you access various features of carplay android with ease. \r\n\r\nCarplay android and Car play auto is a great solution for those who want to make their long drives more enjoyable. With this carplay app, you can watch movies, view photos and play games on a larger car screen, which can be a great way to pass the time. The carplay auto for android claims to provide a smooth experience as your phone connects to your car screen and it is easy and fast to set up whether you are an Android user. Our CarPlay Android Auto app is like having a screen mirror link for your car, offering features to improve your driving experience.\r\n\r\nFeatures of Carplay Auto for Android\r\n\u2714\ufe0fCarplay auto for android works with all cars that have displays\r\n\u2714\ufe0fEasily share your phone screen with the car screen\r\n\u2714\ufe0fConnect your screen to your phone with just one click\r\n\u2714\ufe0fWatch movies & listen to music with ease on carplay auto\r\n\u2714\ufe0fStay safe on the road while sending texts and making calls with Android Carplay \r\n\r\nCarplay for android works with many types of cars including Acura, Bugatti, Ferrari, Honda, Suzuki, Rolls-Royce, Hyundai, Jaguar, Jeep, KIA, Lamborghini, Land Rover, Mercedes Benz, Audi, GMC, BMW and many others.",
